==Problem description==
When the card is not turning on at all, causes the entire computer not to turn on. Caused by a shorted component on 12V or 3.3V rail.
[[File:Turing 12v bus shorts front.jpg|thumb|Possible shorted components for 12V_BUS on a FE 2080. Front side (Figure 1)]]

==Symptoms==

* Sub 100 Ω on the 12V_Bus, 12V_EXT, or 3.3V_BUS.
* Computer won't power on or instantly shutting down upon pressing the power button.
* Fans not spinning (in case of blown fuse).

[[File:Turing 12v bus shorts back.jpg|thumb|Possible shorted components for 12V_BUS on a FE 2080. Back side (Figure 2)]]
[[File:Turing 12v ext shorts front.jpg|thumb|Possible shorted components for 12V_EXT on a FE 2080. Front side (Figure 3)]]
[[File:Turing 12v ext shorts back.jpg|thumb|Possible shorted components for 12V_EXT on a FE 2080. Back side (Figure 4)]]
[[File:Turing 3.3v shorts.jpg|thumb|Possible shorted components for 3.3V_BUS on a FE 2080 (Figure 5)]]

==Solution==
===Diagnostic Steps===
[[How to find short circuits]]
*Identify which rail is shorted by measuring the resistance of each. [[Nvidia Turing GPU Diagnosing Guide|Turing GPU Diagnosing Guide]] here you can find points to measure from
*Inject 1V 10A to the shorted rail
*Check with thermal camera or isopropyl alcohol for hotspots, all possible shorts are in the attached photos.
*In the case of 12V short, make sure to measure VCore voltage while injecting, if you read any voltage higher than 0.1V then a [[Transistors - Repair Basics|MOSFET]] is likely shorting 12V to the GPU then to GND.
**If this is the case, remove the ground power supply lead and connect it to VCore. Then identify the shorted MOSFET/Power Stage.
===Repair Steps===
*After the shorted component has been identified, remove it.
**If the short is still present, repeat the diagnostic steps until you find the other shorted component.
*If the short is gone after removing the component, replace it.
**In the case where the shorted component was a MOSFET and after replacing it shorts again immediately, replace the controller/driver for this MOSFET.